<title>NEW ZEALAND: FCL Energy abandons part of Brunei well.</title>
<headline>FCL Energy abandons part of Brunei well.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fletcher Energy said on Monday it had abandoned part of its Juragan 2B well in Block A, Brunei Darussala.</p>
<p>&quot;Upon completion of the flow testing operations, the horizontal section of the well has been abandoned,&quot; FCL said.</p>
<p>Operations were under way to sidetrack the well to a slightly higher position.</p>
<p>The well would then be tested with a cemented liner, FCL Energy said. FCL Energy has a 53.9 percent interest in the well.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
